   "description": "<p>Letter Keychain/Tag</p><p><i>Included some letter sets; more may follow. &nbsp;Follow the customize section below to create your own.</i></p><h4>Printing / Finishing</h4><ol><li>To embed a logo or text use a first layer height of 0.32mm so only one filament change is needed</li><li>Print vertically rather than flat if printing a single color</li><li>Wet sand with 220, 320, 600 &amp; 1500 grit</li><li>Fill the embedded letters with acrylic paint (3 layers, let dry between)</li><li>Sand again to clean up the paint</li><li>Rinse off with water &amp; dry</li></ol><h3>Customize with your layout</h3><ol><li>Use a layout editor to design your letters</li><li>Download an SVG</li><li>Import into a 3d editor or slicer</li><li>Make a rectangle around the letters (3mm depth)</li></ol><p><i>Note: There are quite a few variations</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
